    "title": "List of Mass. school delays for Wednesday, Feb. 11, after snow falls overnight - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ryan Breslin ,\n18 hours ago The start of school in several Massachusetts communities is delayed on Wednesday morning after overnight snow fell across most of the area.\nClean-up will still be underway in some spots when you hit the road. You’ll need some extra time to clean off your car.\nLynn Public Schools is one district that was closed for the day . Streets were coated with fresh snow. Sidewalks also weren’t shoveled.\nMany other districts announced two-hour delays.\nCheck the link below for a full list of closures and delays:\nClick here to view a full list of early dismissals and closings. For the full forecast, visit the link here .\nDownload the FREE Boston 25 News app for breaking news alerts.\nFollow Boston 25 News on Facebook and Twitter . | Watch Boston 25 News NOW",
